 '054':['登場時查看牌庫頂2張','Official UA51BT/SLG-1-054 黒須 圭介 green0/AP1/BP1500/gen1 ACTIVE life. OnPlay inspect TOP2, send up to one 第四次架南島レイド outside, order the rest to the top. ACTIVE life is the generic handler. https://www.unionarena-tcg.com/jp/cardlist/detail_iframe.php?card_no=UA51BT%2FSLG-1-054 ; not a full FAQ certification.'],
